tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"Olympus: /function olympus/give_all gives eight relics. Take one and use it anywhere to claim a god; if air-use does nothing, use it on any block. /function olympus/summon_mountain gives the mountain sigil. Olympus has a summit altar and stocked chest as another way to choose. /function olympus/controls shows role controls. /function olympus/status, /function olympus/reset, and /function olympus/upgrade_mountain are operator tools."}]}
